ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Playing a cross ruff was a good line^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  Fourth Suit Forcing^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  In 4th seat you sometimes open at the 2-level which is not a weak 2-bid^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  False carding could be confusing to partner^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  Bergen Hand Evaluation is the single best way to improve your bidding^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,6.  Bidding will be influenced substantially in Match Points vs IMPs^*N|


