PG| ***** 17 ***** |


mb|1D|mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|2HP|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|2@H is a reasonable bid by North. That is |CP|1|FP|2|AT|^*Hhttp://www.bridgesights.com/hondobridge/hondoviewer/hondoviewer.php?sf=4sf,Fourth Suit Forcing^*N|CP||FP||at|. It is an artificial bid which establishes a game force.|

