nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|My obligations in responding to that bid are to; 
^Ca) show support for diamonds, or 
^Cb) bid NT with a heart stopper (the 2@H bid says nothing about hearts) it is totally artificial.
^B@2Here I have an obvious 2N call.|
PG| ***** 19 ***** |


mb|2N|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North has a lot of options, although on this hand 3N is the clear call. The other possibilities (with different hands) are 3@D, which shows nice diamonds and possible slam or more importantly 3@S, which is a definite slam try in spades. If North had spades and was not interested in slam he could just bid game in spades.|
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


mb|3N|mb|P|mb|P|mb|P|
pg| ***** 21 ***** |


