pc|H4|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The hand is a little tricky because of the possible blocked clubs. On the surface I have 4 clubs and 3 hearts and need 2 more tricks. Probably my best bet is to try and set up diamonds.|
PG| ***** 22 ***** |


