UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|So I had entry problems and had difficulty because of the blocked clubs in taking 4 club tricks. Perhaps I should have unblocked the clubs first and then worked on diamonds. However, as it turns out that establishes a club trick for East. Plus if I do that, I might have entry issues to the diamonds. So I think my line was reasonable.|
