UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|A lucky game that should not be bid. The spade finesse worked and East happened to play the hearts for only one loser. But East could easily have lost a spade and/or another heart. So 2@H was the best spot.|
PG| ***** 60 ***** |


