mb|1C|mb|P|mb|1H|mb|P|mb|2H|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Although it is sometimes right to raise to 2@H with 3 card support I don't agree with the bid here. It tends to show 4-card support, more often than not, and if you have 3 card support you should normally have higher honors (A, K, or possibly Q) and a more distributional hand usually with a singleton or at least a low doubleton.|
PG| ***** 62 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Here I think the better rebid is 1N although, as it turns out 2@H works out better.|
