UP|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|If West bids 1N, it is not clear what East should do. Normally East would only bid 2@H over 1N with a 6-card suit. However, with such a nice 5-card suit, 2@H would be reasonable as well. And pass would be reasonable as well.|
PG| ***** 80 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|I wouldn't hate double by South, particularly in Match Points. But we would end up in 3@D, and we only have 7 obvious tricks.|
PG| ***** 81 ***** |


